/13.20.570","text":"(3) The liquid waste meets all applicable Federal, State, and City requirements. Any permit issued shall be valid for a period of one year following issuance. (Ord. 20157 § 2, 12-4-18.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2631775f-c353-5bc7-aa34-4aeef32377d8"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.20.570:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}